      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "依赖规则与联机",
      "items": [
        "types/ 不依赖任何模块，全项目共享类型定义",
        "net/ 只经 core/netBus 与 systems 通信，绝不直接 import systems",
        "netBridge 组合根装配 netBus ↔ NetClient：systems emit → netBus → netBridge → net.send",
        "联机架构：房主跑完整物理 + 广播权威状态；客机本地预测 + 接收矫正（偏差 >0.5 格硬矫正）"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "ECS 与预制体体系",
      "items": [
        "core/ecs World 单例：string-key 组件注册 + 按组件索引查询（最少实体优先遍历）",
        "Prefabs/ 提供实体工厂(orb/checkpoint/nova/laser/movingPlatform)与场景绘制委托(platforms/hazards/items/atmosphere)",
        "components/ 10 组件类型：Position·Velocity·Collider·PathMotion·Timer·Hazard·Collectible·RespawnPoint·Goal·PlayerTag",
        "玩家实体把既有 P 对象本身注册为 Position/Velocity 组件数据"
      ]
    }
